# Tidehollow Sculler (cast with two Moxen) reveals Bot2's hand and Bot1 exiles Llanowar Elves from it, leaving the
# lands and the Lightning Bolt. When Bot2 bolts the Sculler, its second ability returns the Elves to Bot2's hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Tidehollow Sculler
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Llanowar Elves
Mountain x4
Mountain x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tidehollow Sculler.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
? Exile.Count = 1
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Tidehollow Sculler)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Tidehollow Sculler
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
Bot2.Battlefield = Mountain
